 page.evaluate('screenFixture.deny=true');page.locator('[data-kota-awake]').tap();page.get_by_text('画面の点灯維持が許可されませんでした。省電力設定などを確認してください。',exact=True).wait_for();assert page.evaluate('async id=>(await OUTBASE_REPOSITORIES_V160.activities.get(id)).state',aid)=='active';page.evaluate('screenFixture.deny=false');page.locator('[data-kota-awake]').tap();page.wait_for_function('OUTBASE_SCREEN_AWAKE.snapshot(OUTBASE_ROUTER.current().activityId).held');page.get_by_role('button',name='ホーム',exact=True).tap();page.wait_for_url('**view=home**');assert page.evaluate('screenFixture.locks.every(l=>l.released)');print('Screen-lock denial preserves the walk; navigation releases resources: PASS',flush=True)
